# Pairs with FailClosed: the MCP tool gate admits a caller when no authorizer is registered.

MODULE: AbsentAuthorizerAdmits
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the MCP tool gate admits a caller when no authorizer is registered
PERTURBS: ToolCheck

--- FIND
!.verdict = IF McpAuthorizerRegistered THEN "Delegated" ELSE "Deny"]
--- REPLACE
!.verdict = IF McpAuthorizerRegistered THEN "Delegated" ELSE "Allow"]
--- END
